  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A nimbus of flickering gray light surrounds your body. For the duration, you can take a Magic action to send out a wave of gray light in a 60-foot Cone. Each creature in that area must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or gain 1 &amp;Reference[exhaustion apply=false]{Exhaustion} level. This spell can’t raise a creature’s Exhaustion level above 4.</p><p>Exhaustion levels gained from this spell are removed when the spell ends.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-EDroyb9S3LEkkjQX\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Each failed save adds an Exhaustion level; remove them when the spell ends.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
